00:00:55.456 --> 00:00:56.465
- Yeah, no. Not too bad.

00:00:56.465 --> 00:00:57.725
- That's awesome.
- We did it!

00:00:57.725 --> 00:00:58.407
- That's super refreshing.

00:00:58.407 --> 00:01:01.727
(upbeat music)

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:03.120
