00:01:07.365 --> 00:01:07.889
- Oh.

00:01:07.889 --> 00:01:10.691
- The kiss was like, it like
neutralized all the food.

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:12.269
- Ugh.

00:01:12.269 --> 00:01:13.523
